WEBVTT

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.450
It's not affecting it!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.350
Three days... This calamity
has occurred in just three days.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.480
First, it was the Jayrock family.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.900
And yesterday, the Bogard family.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:03.280
Both Mafia families have been attacked
by a strange creature and wiped out.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:08.200
According to what the survivors
have said, they saw eyes that glowed blue.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.750
Blue eyes?!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:15.920
That's right. But there's
nothing that we can do anymore.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.920
Sister, what in the world is that thing?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.010
A black dog. It is not of this world.

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.350
Please relax, Detective.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:36.820
We, of the Magdalene Order,
have already begun to act.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.040
Why can't we catch up?!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.460
We're already going
at least fifty miles an hour!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.630
Why, you!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.300
Can't this thing go faster?!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.660
Chrono, take the wheel!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.660
Right!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.000
No way! I missed?!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.920
No! The bullets passed through it!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.480
Rosette!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.920
Cut him to pieces,
my brave May! <i>Mutigster!</i>

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.810
It looks like it's quite far
along in becoming substantial.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.100
So next time we'll have the showdown?

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:39.940
Satella?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:43.150
Why is she here?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.490
Wait, Rosette!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.490
Let go of me! What's she doing here?!

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.950
Rosette!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.970
I'll go call the medical team.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.640
Hold on! Help will be here soon!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.820
No! Hold on!Come on!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.860
Hey! Wait!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:44.880
The true identity of the black dog
that Sister Rosette encountered

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.920
Last night in lower
Manhattan has been revealed.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.680
Bianca Winger,
twenty-two years old, female.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:59.730
Using black magic, she offered her
own life to summon the black dog,

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.690
with the goal of obliterating
all of the Mafioso in New York.

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:06.820
She is the perpetrator who
has triggered this gruesome affair.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.070
Why?

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:10.240
For revenge...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.120
No, because of love, perhaps?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:19.830
It appears that around a half a year ago,
Bianca's fiancé, Richard J. Smith,

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:25.920
got caught up in a gunfight between
the Mafia and the police, and died.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.420
Her fiancé?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:32.890
Sometimes, love is something
that can be changed into deep hatred.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:41.310
I feel so much pity for
her love I cannot stand it.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:48.320
The black dog is
an Astral form that has been created

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:53.570
from Bianca's sadness, her hatred,
her despair, from all the negative emotions.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.450
You could say that its existence
is like an arrow with no substance.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:01.790
Does that mean that we
can't attack it or seal it away?

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.630
As the black dog consumes them,

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.210
its body will become larger,

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.300
and it will become more substantial.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:25.060
First, I need to be grateful to that monster.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:29.270
Grateful?
To a monster that is aiming to kill you?

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:33.110
Thanks to it
eliminating Jayrock and Bogard,

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:36.870
the town has gotten pretty quiet.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:41.580
But shouldn't you be
worrying about yourself, Don Gotti?

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:44.210
If the black dog obtains
a completely substantial body,

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:47.250
then my being here will
have absolutely no meaning.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.720
It's going to take a little
more time and some offerings

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.260
for you to be able to sleep peacefully.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:09:02.770
Until then, please take care of us,
jewel witch, Satella Harvenheit.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.770
As for offerings,
I'll ready as many as I need to.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.860
You're pretty cold,

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:11.020
especially for someone
who's known as a Godfather.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:15.530
Miss Satella, there are
times when the head of the family

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.370
has to make tough decisions
for the sake of his family's happiness.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.910
Familial love, is it?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.830
In order to protect something,

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:26.580
it's inevitable that
some sacrifices must be made.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.090
Isn't that right?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:34.380
I don't despise that way of thinking.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.230
I can't agree with this way of doing things!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:52.230
Waiting to attack until
the black dog has completely materialized?

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.490
Are you telling me to stand by silently
and watch people get killed until then?!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:03.450
Then tell me, what other
methods are there, Sister Rosette?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.370
How are you going to fight against
a creature that can run eighty miles an hour

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.540
and that has no substantial form?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.500
I don't know that either.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.550
But... But I can't...

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:25.220
Even if they are Mafioso, I...

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.850
To have to stand by silently
and watch people be killed...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.900
...I can't do something like that!

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:39.400
At this time, we have no other options.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:43.330
This matter has been
decided by the Magdalene Order.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.080
I cannot accept that! Excuse me!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.960
Wait, Sister Rosette!
We are not finished talking!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.800
Seriously, that girl is...

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.970
She's certainly learned
to speak out, hasn't she?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:06.060
I'm sure that sense of justice comes
from her ability to believe in everything.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:21.030
Amazing!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.450
This is a super-high-speed bike!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.870
It's named the Gabriel Hound!

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.660
We asked you to fix the car,

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:34.630
and just as I realized that
we hadn't seen you around for a while...

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.210
I never thought that you'd
come up with something like this.

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:43.550
Yahoo!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:49.020
Hey! How much can I
squeeze out of this engine?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:53.690
It's a 1500cc engine!
It's steady at ninety miles per hour!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.570
It uses the newest
model of Harley as its base,

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.900
and I've thrown in all of the
newest speed-increasing technologies!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.240
So you've noticed it.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.450
If you press that, you can use

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.750
the rocket booster for
super acceleration, but only twice.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.910
Amazing, amazing!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.960
With this we'll be able to
catch up to the black dog!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.960
I didn't make this
for the Magdalene Order!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.880
What? You're not going to lend it to us?

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:26.300
If you let me fondle
your breasts, I'll lend it to you.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.310
Rosette, it's terrible!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.990
Damn that mustached old codger!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.990
Now you've gone and done it!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.710
Hey! The backup still isn't here yet?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.870
They're heading this way right now!

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.860
Take form,

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.500
Cut him to pieces! <i>Mutigster!</i>

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:45.530
Woohoo! What a magnificent view!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.060
Why did it split into two?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.480
I don't know!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.810
It's multiplied already,
so it can't be helped!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.900
Don't tell me...

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.650
...is this your fault?

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.320
It wasn't completely substantial yet.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:39.250
Man! Why can't you do
anything but cause me problems?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.250
Hey, you

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.380
Chrono, we're going after
the one that just ran away!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.920
That seems to be impossible.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.840
You're kidding me, right?!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.680
Oh, what are we going to do?!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.730
We can't chase the black dog like this!

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:04.230
Chrono, have you gotten through to Elder?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.770
It's no use, I can't get through.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.070
The subway's out of range after all.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.320
It's no use.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.700
The ritual of
the black dog's massacre will not end

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.370
until it consumes all
of the Mafioso in New York.

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.250
No one can stop it now!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:21.200
Why?!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:26.790
Why do you always jump
to that conclusion so quickly?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:34.050
No matter how much trouble
I'm in, no matter how much it hurts,

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.050
I don't give up, no matter what!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.430
Isn't it okay anyway?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:46.310
The ones being killed this time
are human trash that deserve it.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.190
Robbery, murder, narcotics,

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.650
this is their reward
for doing as they pleased.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.490
That's not true.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.700
Even if they are criminals,

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.370
there absolutely aren't
any people who deserve to die!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.080
What a beautiful sentiment.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.630
But people are different
from the God you believe in.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:12.510
They aren't tolerant
enough to love their enemy.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.890
If it's for their own goals, it doesn't matter
if it's their own lives or someone else's.

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:21.560
Are you saying you'd put your
life on the line for people like that?!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:25.560
Such hypocrisy.
Just what I'd expect from a Sister.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.360
Think about yourself first
before you think of other people.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.690
That is the proper way for a person to live.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:35.860
That's true.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.820
Everything you've said...

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.700
...might be correct.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.040
But...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.380
...it's so correct,
it makes me a little angry.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.090
Even if I get called a hypocrite...

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.920
No matter what I get called,

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:59.260
I can't just stand by
silently and watch people get killed.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:07.520
Hey, are any of your
summoned beasts really fast?

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:13.320
I'll show you the spirit
of what you call a hypocrite!

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:26.330
This is perfect!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:30.250
What kind of girl are you,
doing things so recklessly?

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.800
Seriously, she's so rash.

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:48.600
I can see him!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.480
He's gotten onto the shaft line!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.110
I'm counting on you to keep us on course!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.900
Are you trying to give me orders?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.580
So it really is no use from behind.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.840
Satella, hold on tight!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.300
We're going to get ahead
of him and smash in his head.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.130
Wait! What are you thinking?!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.760
Go!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.520
It's no use, we can't get past him!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.690
This is nothing! One more time, go!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:43.160
Bring peace to the lost lambs,

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.780
give rest to the fangs of the wolf,

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.790
and call the hammer
of death unto the devil!

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.560
What the heck?!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.100
Rosette...

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.580
What do you think?
It went perfectly well, didn't it?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.880
Seriously, I just can't deal with you.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.570
Haven't you forgotten me?

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:04.200
Hey, haven't you forgotten me?
